    "detailed_description": "RocketJumpCascade is a speedrunning platformer that will put your movement skills to the test. Embark on an exciting adventure as you explore intricate rifts to uncover new areas and attempt to beat your best times. With fast-paced and fluid gameplay, RocketJumpCascade offers a unique and challenging experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>About the Game</u></h2>Your goal is to master the RocketJump, and find the quickest path through each level, unlocking new paths and secrets as you progress. You will have to use your reflexes, precision and creativity to discover optimal routes, and master your abilities to jump, blast and surf to beat your best time and reach the top of the leaderboard.<br><br>The game features a variety of environments and obstacles, each one more challenging than the last. But don't worry, as you improve, new powers, mechanics and items will be unlocked, making the gameplay more and more fun.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 18 Different Levels to explore and optimize your best times<br></li><li>Fluid and responsive movement mechanics that focus on rocket jumping and other advanced techniques<br></li><li>Momentum system based on Source engine games<br></li><li>Fast-paced gameplay that will put your reflexes and precision to the test<br></li><li>Power-ups and new areas that can be unlocked as you progress, adding new layers of depth to the gameplay<br></li><li>Regularly planned updates to improve the game</li></ul>",
